const sources=[
 ['ama','American Medical Association: work beyond appointments','Its 2024 survey discussion distinguishes direct care, indirect care, administration and work outside normal hours. It does not validate this proposed schedule.','https://www.ama-assn.org/practice-management/physician-health/doctors-work-fewer-hours-ehr-still-follows-them-home'],
 ['aafp','AAFP: Direct primary care','Category, physician career options and general pricing context. The overview links to its 2024 data brief. This is not an Austin price survey.','https://www.aafp.org/practice-operations/practice-and-payment-models/direct-primary-care'],
 ['frontier','DPC Frontier: DPC defined','The organization’s definition includes periodic fees and limits on per-visit charges. Category terminology does not determine tax treatment.','https://www.dpcfrontier.com/defined'],
 ['irs','IRS Notice 2026-5','Contribution eligibility and reimbursement from an existing HSA have different rules. See questions 11–13 and 20.','https://www.irs.gov/pub/irs-drop/n-26-05.pdf'],
