 ['fda','FDA: human drug compounding','Compounded drugs are not FDA approved. Candidate therapies require a current, product-specific evidence, sourcing and regulatory review.','https://www.fda.gov/drugs/guidance-compliance-regulatory-information/human-drug-compounding'],
